        <p class="section-intro">Under the Centrally Sponsored <strong>Per Drop More Crop (PDMC)</strong> scheme, financial assistance is calculated against Government of India indicative unit cost norms and transferred directly to beneficiary bank accounts via Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT).</p>

        <div class="subsidy-highlights">
          <article class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-badge">Small &amp; Marginal Farmers (≤ 2 ha)</span>
